# CREDITS — The Orchard at First Light

A 10-second Crayon Picture Book film, made entirely in code.

## Picture
Canvas2D crayon engine (`crayon.js`): waxy ribbons, zig-zag hatching, paper tooth,
hand wobble and 12 fps boil. Paper, wash, vignette and the hand-written title are
drawn in `film.js`.

## Type
- Gaegu Bold — SIL Open Font License 1.1 (`fonts/OFL-Gaegu.txt`)
- Patrick Hand Regular — SIL Open Font License 1.1 (`fonts/OFL-PatrickHand.txt`)

## Music
Original 10 s music-box score, synthesised for this film (`music.py`) with the
library's physical models (`core/audio/pluck.py`). No sample libraries are used.
